  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEach DRINK purchased during
    this run adds 4% to this ally's weapon damage, up to +40%. Applies when the next
    battle is prepared; not a team-wide damage buff.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nChampion
    / Healing per second: +0.04\nChampion / Movement speed: -0.3%\nTier 1/2/3 traits
    \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING
    REALM\nBorn above the station kitchens, they fed travellers through a winter
    with no departures. Every cup was counted; nobody knew whether they had eaten.
    They want a table where the last person serving is also given a seat.\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, attempt to heal the hero for 1.5 HP before healing
    modifiers. Healing restrictions apply.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed
    memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly
    stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: hearth,
    mask. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
